  "timeline": [
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The acting commission secretary will continue until the new director selects a private secretary.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:27:22",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Motion to assign a commissioner to lead drafting letters to the candidates and other offices: The commission assigned a commissioner to work with legal counsel on drafting letters to the candidates and other offices as required.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:23:41",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Legal counsel said a press release may follow later, after the mayor's office is notified.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:23:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Legal counsel said letters would also go to the mayor's office and the council.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:22:58",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "A commissioner will lead drafting letters to the selected finalist and the two other finalists.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:22:02",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The chair said the job offer stands, pending a successful outcome of that process.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:20:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Legal counsel said she can work with the interim director to set up the background check for Department of Personnel Services (DPS).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:19:27",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The interim director said Department of Personnel Services (DPS) does not currently run background checks.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:19:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Counsel said a recent audit found the county lacked uniform screening and background checks.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:16:45",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Legal counsel raised a post-offer background check, a check done after a job offer.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:14:59",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The interim director and interim deputy director were asked to continue until the final appointment is made.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:14:07",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Motion to appoint the top-ranked finalist as the new director: The commission approved appointing the top-ranked finalist as the new Department of Personnel Services (DPS) director on a roll call vote announced as unanimous.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:12:14",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "A commissioner moved to appoint the top-ranked finalist as director, and Commissioner Lee seconded.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:10:21",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The top-ranked finalist received 378 of 450 points and ranked first overall.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:07:46",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "Each commissioner scored finalists out of 90 points, for a possible total of 450.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:06:23",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The commission received 17 applications, with identifying details removed before review.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:04:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The meeting's purpose was to choose a new director of Department of Personnel Services (DPS).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:02:28",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-08",
      "text": "The Civil Service Commission reconvened a meeting that had been recessed on October 7.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "fTuTemrBtCY",
        "ts": "0:00:41",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:51:21.505Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-07",
      "text": "The selection of a new director of personnel services was put off because the chair was not present.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "yMbc5cKnAGk",
        "ts": "0:05:26",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:47:59.118Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "Motion to go into executive session under HRS 92-5A4: The commission voted to go into executive session to consult its attorney about including public testimony.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "3:46:48",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "A commissioner said if none of the three fits, the commission may start over.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "3:43:53",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "Scores may be discussed in executive session because they contain sensitive information.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "3:27:23",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "The final choice will be made by majority vote, not consensus.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "3:22:07",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "Public testimony will be accepted up to the day of the meeting, but earlier written testimony gives commissioners more time to review it.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "3:01:16",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "Commissioners may ask the candidates follow-up questions by phone and bring the answers back to the whole commission.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "2:49:04",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "Commissioners plan to meet October 7 to review the candidates and hopefully decide.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "2:48:53",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "Candidates will be told the commission's decision.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "2:47:25",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "She said she is applying because she worries the county's HR project could fall flat.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "2:35:55",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "He said Department of Personnel Services (DPS) turned down his department's retention incentive plan as too hard to negotiate.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "1:42:56",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "The second candidate said he is a public works deputy director with 11 years at the county.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "1:01:11",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "The first candidate said his approach would have a strong labor focus built on trust.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "0:05:13",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "The meeting was for interviews of candidates for Department of Personnel Services (DPS) director.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "0:01:34",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-30",
      "text": "The Civil Service Commission of the County of Maui met September 30, 2026, at about 9:02 a.m.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "sf2Uy63wJNE",
        "ts": "0:00:31",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T20:19:47.406Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Commissioners divided five interview questions among themselves.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:24:24",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Final choices on who asks which question must be made after the meeting starts at 9:00.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:23:45",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "A commissioner said an earlier call to keep Department of Personnel Services (DPS) staff out applied only to an earlier stage.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:19:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Yukari will draft the invitation email to Department of Personnel Services (DPS) employees.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:17:51",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Motion to extend an invitation to members of Department of Personnel Services (DPS) to be a part of the selection process: The motion to invite DPS employees to take part in the selection process carried.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:17:26",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Employees are invited to watch the interviews live and send anonymous comments afterward.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:16:23",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Each applicant will give a 3- to 5-minute summary of their statement before answering questions.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:15:20",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "All applicants will arrive at 9:00, be kept in a separate room, and be interviewed one at a time.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:15:06",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Interviews are set for the 30th.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:13:59",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "A final email will tell candidates their interview time may be earlier or later depending on public testimony.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:09:50",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "Commissioners agreed to keep the schedule as prepared and stay flexible.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:07:09",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "A draft schedule sets interviews at 10:00, 12:00 and 2:00.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:05:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-28",
      "text": "The goal was to finalize the timeline and selection process for the department's new leader.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "H9lx2zorcDM",
        "ts": "0:03:10",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-06T04:46:18.801Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "Commissioners will work on interview questions between now and the 16th.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "1:58:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "Commissioners discussed writing interview questions in groups of two.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "1:57:31",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "The chair suggested putting the director search topic on the agenda for the 16th.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "1:37:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "Commissioners discussed a full day of candidate interviews on the 30th.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "1:26:14",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "A commissioner pointed to a 25-point gap between the fourth- and fifth-ranked candidates.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "1:19:05",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "Staff said two director candidates had confirmed so far, with a deadline this Friday.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "1:12:37",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-26",
      "text": "Stakeholder engagement email: The commission authorized a commissioner to write the stakeholder email and send it with help from county lawyers and the personnel department.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
